## Warnings (non-blocking)

These appear in gateway logs but do not prevent the app from running:

- **No user allowlists configured** — no messaging platforms (Telegram, Discord, etc.) are set up. Normal for a fresh Desktop-only install.
- **No API_SERVER_KEY set** — the API server accepts all requests without authentication. Fine for local development; set `API_SERVER_KEY` in `Agent/.env` before exposing the gateway on a network.

